#speaker:???
black and white, this Zebra is strangely wearing a gasmask inside the train. He doesn't seem to want to talk to others
*•	Hi sir, I'm the train conductor, what's your name?
You hear is voice muffled under his gasmask. Hello, my name is Ivan Solovei. Thank you for welcoming me in your journey. #speaker:Ivan
->Ivan1
===Ivan1===
* you're welcome, Ivan.
** I have to ask, why the gasmask?
He touch the mask with his hand. it feels better than without it.
->Ivan1
**•	How are you feeling ?
I'm well, thank you.
/*[If lost 1 health] : he's looking in pain. It hurts badly, I hope we can find a doctor soon.
/*[if lost 2 health] :*/ he's clearly weaken, breathing loudly through his mask. I am on the verge of death, and I have so much regrets...
->IvanBlessure
===IvanBlessure===
* don't worry, Ivan, as soon as I can find a doctor, you'll get back on your feet.
He looks at you in the eye. Thank you, even though I don't deserv it.
->IvanLocalisation
* what kind of regrets?
He hesitating I... made some terrible decisions. By my fault many suffered and died. I'm a monster...
->IvanRegret
===IvanRegret===
* what are you talking about, Ivan?
I... he speak softly ...I'm a Okhotnik na krys, a rat hunter. He sob I'm a monster…
you understand now that he's a quisler, he worked for the ennemy general Zhenya Ozerova, known as the lady of despair. As he seems regretful about it, he's a traitor to the country.
// get your shit and get off my train, you piece of shit.
//You quickly stop the train. He's silently crying while he take his backpack and luggage, and descent on the rails. He doesn't even dare to look at anyones eyes, too ashamed of himself. As he descent, he try to say something, but change his mind and walk in the snow.
//When you restart the train and resume your journey, you see him collapse in the snow, holding his head in his hands.
** maybe you regret what you did, and that does make you a monster, but you don't deserve to die. You deserve to live, to carry this burden as long as you can. That is your punishment.
He's contemplating on your words, but does not say a word.
->IvanLocalisation
** not you Ivan... why, why did you do it?
I did it because I fear death, I did it because I'm a coward and a monster. Let me die, that's the least I can do, to die in great pain.
*** it must be the fever speaking because you make no sense. Rest now, we'll take care of you.
You don't understand... he lay his head back, barely hiding his tears. You don't understand...
->IvanLocalisation
===IvanLocalisation===
*•	where are you from ?
I'm from the more eastern part of Zlamanyy, I grew up in Zazno, a big city on the other side of the mountains.
** oh so you're a local?
Yes, I descent from a line of miners. I'm actually the first in my line to not have worked in a mine.
*** what did you do for a living?
I used to be a... he's searching for his words. ...financial advisor.
**** what does that mean?
It means I have a deep knowledge on how and where money flow. I can tell you where to put it as well as where some financial transit operate.
->IvanBagage
===IvanBagage===
* •	what's bringing you aboard my train ?
The need to start a new life, I guess
** like everyone else, wouldn't you say ?
Maybe.
