** what kind of life ?
    A kinder one. What that wordplay? From Ivan?
***what do you mean?
To be a better person, one that help others.
**** and start a family ?
No, that I couldn't.
***** why not, I'm sure you are very approachable once you drop the mask and the attitude.
I don't want to impose a child to have a father as myself.
