We've had... differences. But it doesn't matters now, I think I won't ever see them again.
***•	What will you do once in the neutral zone ?
Open a business in the Cardisian continent, and raise money to help people like you bring more people like them... he looks at the rest of the people of the train... to a better life.
**** that's a great plan !
That's the least I can do, but thank you.
